    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You're just a simple farmer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some animals generate gold, others collect gold, and yet more can defend your herd. Every creature has a place on your farm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">With two double-barreled shotguns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the forest comes a knockin' let your guns do the talking. With the help of your dogs, put a stop to the wild beasts that emerge from the trees. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who just wants to have the most impressive flock the world has ever seen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the size of your herd increases, so does their power; upgrade your creatures to make them more powerful</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And make some time for a bit of partying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to activate the party machine! It's a bit noisy, attracting dangerous animals from the forest. Once you've dealt with them, your herd throws down and goes into overdrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You're just a simple farmer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some animals generate gold, others collect gold, and yet more can defend your herd. Every creature has a place on your farm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">With two double-barreled shotguns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the forest comes a knockin' let your guns do the talking. With the help of your dogs, put a stop to the wild beasts that emerge from the trees. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who just wants to have the most impressive flock the world has ever seen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the size of your herd increases, so does their power; upgrade your creatures to make them more powerful</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And make some time for a bit of partying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to activate the party machine! It's a bit noisy, attracting dangerous animals from the forest. Once you've dealt with them, your herd throws down and goes into overdrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Grow your herd while protecting them from dangerous forest creatures. As your flock grows so does their power, upgrade them to be better, faster, and stronger. Unlock new creatures to aid you in your goal of having the largest group of grazers!",
